Have you done sokoban yet?  The amulet would really benefit you, as
reflection is the one major piece of the puzzle you're missing.  If
you don't get the amulet I'd recommend wishing up SDSM.

You should also identify your scrolls, to see if you have any
genocide.  In my pacifist runs I've genocided anything that could eat
my Archon, namely purple worms and team t.  Trices aren't a threat to
your Archon, but your Archon also won't kill them.  I like to genocide
team c, but some people prefer to keep them around for use with a ring
of conflict.  And a general note about Archon care...since you have
magic resistance, use a pick-axe to turn any polytraps or levelports
into pits.

The loss of the Oracle doesn't doom your pacifist, but you will want
to be at least XL 2 before you start getting with that foocubus to
avoid instadeath.  One of my pacifists didn't make use of the Oracle,
and instead used potions of gain level.  But I didn't have my Archon
at that point...since you do, you also have a pretty good shot at
getting wraith corpses to eat.  I know you won't find any wraith
corpses where you are currently, but once you get reflection you'll be
fairly safe to explore deeper in the dungeon, even as a low level
character.

